  "id": "chickpea-tagine-with-couscous",
  "name": "Chickpea Tagine with Couscous",
  "subtitle": "A warmly spiced chickpea stew with sweet dried fruit and peppers.",
  "description": "Simmer chickpeas, tomatoes, piquillo peppers, dates or prunes, and tagine paste until thick, then serve with couscous.",
